    "causal_summary": "Before this phase the hub resolved through the legacy path: it was absent from the engine's dispatch map, so `compiled-route.cjs --hub cli-jev` returned the sentinel, `loadHubEngine` threw `unknown hub`, and every compiled-routing view (status, guard, admission, the foundation lockstep suite) treated the hub as unregistered",
